      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "WINGED WONDER (1) showed little early speed at her last couple, the latest finishing fourth (20.57) in a Grade 5 at this track. Form at the trip sound including three wins. Worth another chance. TEMPO AND TOUCH (8) is a capable type and proved too strong last time to win by a neck at this track in a handy 20.03 beating VAN NOSTRAND. Expected to feature again. VAN NOSTRAND (5) jumped from out wide and was game in defeat last start when a neck second (20.05) behind TEMPO AND TOUCH at this track. Expected to be in the finish again. STRIKING BEACH (2) is a last start winner worth following up.",
